WEBVTT

00:13:59.710 --> 00:14:04.172
Freedom, life and love

00:14:04.214 --> 00:14:07.384
versus tyranny, death and hatred.

00:14:09.094 --> 00:14:11.638
This is not chess.

00:14:12.389 --> 00:14:15.100
But sometimes things are black and white.

00:14:15.684 --> 00:14:18.520
Sometimes you have to fight
for what you believe.

00:14:20.355 --> 00:14:21.690
Or you lose it.

00:14:22.274 --> 00:14:23.734
This is not chess.

00:14:24.484 --> 00:14:30.449
There are no draws, no compromises
in our battle with true evil.